{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ulnuw1uuY61794581652.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>歐元區第三季經濟增長符合市場預期。</p><p></p><p>歐洲統計局公布，歐元區國內生產總值第三季終值按年上升百分之1.3，較第二季高0.1個百分點，並與市場預期相同。按季比較，上升百分之0.4，較第二季低0.2個百分點，但符合市場預期。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T15:36:23.735878+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T02:11:11.823470+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T15:29:43.015168+00:00","content_hash":"cad9d07523c6e5892c993a6cec63811a5691ccf29273ae409998820f6bd0f827","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}